        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The map below shows the development of the village of Ryemouth between 1995 and present. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YBH9dBuTpocbP5xpkcfl63pugwg\"><em><strong>The map below shows the development of the village of Ryemouth between 1995 and present. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Ryemouth Village Development Over Time</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Ryemouth Village Development Over Time y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự ph&aacute;t triển của l&agrave;ng Ryemouth từ năm 1995 đến nay</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Ryemouth Village Development Over Time với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: sự chuyển đổi của l&agrave;ng Ryemouth - năm 1995 v&agrave; hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">L&agrave;ng Ryemouth đ&atilde; trải qua sự ph&aacute;t triển đ&aacute;ng kể, chuyển m&igrave;nh từ một ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng gắn với nghề đ&aacute;nh c&aacute; v&agrave; n&ocirc;ng nghiệp sang <em>một điểm đến du lịch (tourism-oriented destination)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Sự thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; nhất l&agrave; việc loại bỏ to&agrave;n bộ <em>cơ sở hạ tầng li&ecirc;n quan đến đ&aacute;nh c&aacute; (fishing-related infrastructure)</em>, đồng thời bổ sung <em>c&aacute;c tiện &iacute;ch thể thao mới (sports amenities)</em> v&agrave; <em>nơi ở bổ sung (additional accommodation)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> khu vực ph&iacute;a bắc v&agrave; ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng của l&agrave;ng</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả khu vực đ&ocirc;ng bắc của l&agrave;ng năm 1995 v&agrave; sự thay đổi:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">C&oacute; <em>đất n&ocirc;ng nghiệp (farmland) </em>chiếm khu vực đ&ocirc;ng bắc v&agrave;o năm 1995</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Đất n&ocirc;ng nghiệp n&agrave;y đ&atilde; được thay thế bằng <em>một s&acirc;n golf (golf course)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả khu vực ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng của l&agrave;ng năm 1995 v&agrave; sự thay đổi:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Khu vực n&agrave;y trước đ&acirc;y<em> chưa được ph&aacute;t triển (previously undeveloped)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>C&aacute;c s&acirc;n tennis (tennis courts)</em> đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng ngay ph&iacute;a nam của s&acirc;n golf</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả c&ocirc;ng vi&ecirc;n rừng ở khu vực trung-đ&ocirc;ng:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">C&oacute; <em>một c&ocirc;ng vi&ecirc;n rừng (forest park)</em> nằm ở phần <em>trung-đ&ocirc;ng (central-eastern)</em> của l&agrave;ng v&agrave;o năm 1995</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">C&ocirc;ng vi&ecirc;n rừng n&agrave;y <em>đ&atilde; bị giải tỏa ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n (entirely cleared)</em>, nhường chỗ cho <em>c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng tr&igrave;nh giải tr&iacute; mới (new recreational developments)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> khu vực trung t&acirc;m, ph&iacute;a nam v&agrave; đ&ocirc;ng nam của l&agrave;ng</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c thay đổi ở khu vực t&acirc;y nam:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\">Cửa h&agrave;ng ở g&oacute;c t&acirc;y nam đ&atilde;<em> được chuyển đổi th&agrave;nh nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng (converted into a restaurant)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Chợ c&aacute; (fish market)</em> liền kề đ&atilde; <em>bị ph&aacute; dỡ (demolished)</em> v&agrave; thay thế bằng <em>một d&atilde;y căn hộ (a block of apartments)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả cảng c&aacute; ở khu vực ven biển ph&iacute;a nam:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTPed1g1hoylwox5mXFltXnvgQf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><em>Cảng c&aacute; (fishing port) </em>từng l&agrave; đặc điểm nổi bật dọc bờ biển ph&iacute;a nam <em>đ&atilde; kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n tồn tại (no longer exists)</em> trong bố cục hiện tại</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả kh&aacute;ch sạn v&agrave; qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc;:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\">Kh&aacute;ch sạn ở khu vực trung-đ&ocirc;ng<em> đ&atilde; được giữ lại (retained),</em> nhưng nay c&oacute; th&ecirc;m <em>một b&atilde;i đỗ xe (car park)</em> liền kề</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; (cafe)</em> ở khu vực ph&iacute;a nam<em> vẫn kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sự thay đổi (remained unchanged)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự mở rộng khu d&acirc;n cư ở g&oacute;c t&acirc;y bắc:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Khu d&acirc;n cư (housing estate)</em> ở g&oacute;c t&acirc;y bắc <em>đ&atilde; được mở rộng (expanded)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Một h&agrave;ng nh&agrave; mới (a new row of houses) </em>đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng ở <em>ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y của con đường ch&iacute;nh (western side of the main road)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3213,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The maps illustrate the transformation that took place in the village of Ryemouth between 1995 and the present day.</p>",
            "question_id": 41915,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3214,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, Ryemouth has undergone significant development, shifting from a village with a fishing industry and agricultural land to a tourism-oriented destination. Most notably, all fishing-related infrastructure has been removed, while new sports amenities and additional accommodation have been constructed.</p>",
            "question_id": 41915,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3215,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the northern and eastern parts of the village, the farmland that previously occupied the northeastern area has been replaced by a golf course, and tennis courts have been constructed immediately to the south of it. Additionally, the forest park that once stood in the central-eastern part of the village has been entirely cleared, making way for these new recreational developments.</p>",
            "question_id": 41915,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3216,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Turning to the southern and western areas, the shop located in the southwestern part of the village was converted into a restaurant, while the adjacent fish market was demolished and replaced with a block of apartments. Furthermore, the fishing port, which had previously served as a key feature along the southern coastline, no longer exists in the present layout. In contrast, the hotel situated in the central-eastern area has been retained, though a car park has been added alongside it. The cafe in the southern section also remained unchanged throughout the period. Finally, the housing estate in the northwestern corner saw some expansion, with a new row of houses being constructed on the western side of the main road.</p>",
            "question_id": 41915,
            "is_toggle_on": true
